#: src/lessons/recursion/hanoi/LinearHanoiEntity.java:11
#: src/lessons/recursion/hanoi/LinearTwinHanoiEntity.java:10
msgid ""
"Sorry Dave, I cannot let you move disks between slots 0 and 2 directly. Use "
"the intermediate slot in all moves."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍໂທດເດີ ເດຟ, ຂ້ອຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຍ້າຍແຜ່ນມົນລະຫວ່າງຊ່ອງ 0 ຫາ 2 ໂດຍກົງບໍ່ໄດ້. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງກາງໃນທຸກການຍ້າຍ."

#: src/lessons/recursion/hanoi/universe/HanoiEntity.java:55
#, java-format
msgid ""
"Sorry Dave, I cannot let you move disks counterclockwise. Move from 0 to 1, "
"from 1 to 2 or from 2 to 0 only, not from {0} to {1}."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍໂທດເດີ ເດຟ, ຂ້ອຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຍ້າຍແຜ່ນມົນທວນເຂັມໂມງບໍ່ໄດ້. ໃຫ້ຍ້າຍຈາກ 0 ໄປ 1, ຈາກ 1 ໄປ 2 ຫຼື ຈາກ "
"2 ໄປ 0 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນຈາກ {0} ໄປ {1}."

